Subject: Semantic Anchor Slice5B WSL Path Transport Fault

@ [fault_uuid] 986faf82-2a80-46f7-aa31-87aecc6ddbfc

& [Observation]
  + the first live runner passed an unquoted Windows temporary path through wslpath and Bash consumed its backslashes
  + the controller received no converted path and refused before accepting any trial evidence

& [Resolution]
  + replace the transport with a bounded local drive-letter conversion to slash-normalized /mnt drive paths
  + rerun completed all seven exact-output trials and verify-only acceptance
  + no WSL configuration remote path product source or security policy changed
